@base = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Wallets (one per user)
# @name asha
POST {{base}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "asha" }

###
# @name ravi
POST {{base}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "ravi" }

### 2. Top-up ₹1000 -> 201 SUCCESS
POST {{base}}/wallets/{{asha.response.body.data.id}}/top-ups
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: topup-asha-0001

{ "amountPaise": 100000, "paymentToken": "tok_ok" }

### 3. Same key -> 200 Idempotent-Replayed (not charged again)
POST {{base}}/wallets/{{asha.response.body.data.id}}/top-ups
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: topup-asha-0001

{ "amountPaise": 100000, "paymentToken": "tok_ok" }

### 4. Same key, different amount -> 422
POST {{base}}/wallets/{{asha.response.body.data.id}}/top-ups
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: topup-asha-0001

{ "amountPaise": 5, "paymentToken": "tok_ok" }

### 5. Transfer ₹400 to Ravi
POST {{base}}/wallets/{{asha.response.body.data.id}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: trf-asha-0001

{ "toWalletId": "{{ravi.response.body.data.id}}", "amountPaise": 40000, "note": "lunch" }

### 6. More than the balance -> 422 { balancePaise, requestedPaise }
POST {{base}}/wallets/{{asha.response.body.data.id}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: trf-asha-0002

{ "toWalletId": "{{ravi.response.body.data.id}}", "amountPaise": 70000 }

### 7. Withdrawal to a closed account (ends 0000) -> 422; money comes back as a reversal entry
POST {{base}}/wallets/{{asha.response.body.data.id}}/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: wd-asha-0001

{ "amountPaise": 10000, "bankAccount": "123450000" }

### 8. Statement (ledger entries, newest first)
GET {{base}}/wallets/{{asha.response.body.data.id}}/statement?page=1&limit=10

### 9. Reconcile: cached balance == sum of ledger entries
GET {{base}}/wallets/{{asha.response.body.data.id}}/reconcile

### 10. Whole ledger: credits − debits = 0
GET {{base}}/wallets/ledger-check

### 11. Freeze -> transfers to/from it are 422
POST {{base}}/wallets/{{ravi.response.body.data.id}}/freeze
